# 🧩 TEMPLATE 2 — Longest Window (Shrink When Invalid)

### Core Template

```python
left = 0
for right in range(len(nums)):
    add(nums[right])

    while window_invalid():
        remove(nums[left])
        left += 1

    result = max(result, right - left + 1)
```

### 🧪 Problems

**Level 1**

