# 🧩 TEMPLATE 4 — Sliding Window + Frequency Map

### Core Template

```python
freq = {}

for right in range(len(s)):
    freq[s[right]] += 1

    while invalid():
        freq[s[left]] -= 1
        left += 1
```

### 🧪 Problems

1️⃣1️⃣ Find All Anagrams in a String

1️⃣2️⃣ Permutation in String

